    Light Arena" once per turn. Once per turn: You can target 1 Set card in your
    opponent''s Spell & Trap Zone; while this card is in the Field Zone, that Set
    card cannot be activated until the End Phase, and your opponent must activate
    it during the End Phase or else return it to the hand.'
